**Pattern (measured, not inferred):** `/Videos/{id}/stream` has now produced **three separate CVEs** (2023-49096 → patch → 2025-31499 patch-bypass → 2026-35033 by a different parameter path) *because the endpoint itself is intentionally unauthenticated.* The unauthenticated design decision from Emby is the persistent root; each CVE is a downstream leaf.

